* SYMBAL PROGRAM TO ADD TWO NUMBERS
* THIS IS A SIMPLE ADDITION PROGRAM

START   LOAD    A       LOAD FIRST NUMBER
        ADD     B       ADD SECOND NUMBER
        STORE   C       STORE RESULT
        HALT            STOP EXECUTION

A       DATA    5       FIRST NUMBER
B       DATA    3       SECOND NUMBER
C       DATA    0       RESULT LOCATION
        END     START
